WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,540
Copied tickets will soon turn into waste paper

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,340
People who now exchange money for current affairs

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,620
Sooner or later you will regret it

4
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:16,630
This kind of cheap dry food used to be

5
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:18,070
I won't touch it

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:21,900
Now I don’t want to waste even the leftovers.

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:28,540
Just make five bags and three bags of instant noodles

8
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,140
Half a bottle of Lao Gan Ma

9
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,940
The rice noodles have been eaten up long ago

10
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:34,500
Just this little thing can't fill your stomach.

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,820
If this continues

12
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,040
Sooner or later we will starve to death

13
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,960
Does Zhou Peng still have food in stock?

14
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,480
The last two packages of instant noodles have been given away at his house.

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,380
Now I'm so thin

16
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,860
No more fish food at all
